<title>FRANCE: Lagardere 1996 net attrib 1.04 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Lagardere 1996 net attrib 1.04 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			   1,038  vs	     630</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)		     3.70  vs	    3.00</p>
<p>Operating				    2,636  vs	   2,168</p>
<p>Tax						244  vs	     338</p>
<p>Pre-tax, pre-exceptional		 2,443  vs	   2,013</p>
<p>Exceptional losses			   453  vs	     258</p>
<p>Financial loss				 193  vs	     155</p>
<p>Turnover				    56,401  vs	  52,579</p>
<p>NOTE - Lagardere's results were released in a statement. -- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
